   <div class="acc-panel" id="acc-p-premium" role="region" aria-labelledby="acc-b-premium"><div><div class="body">The app describes the yearly plan as ad-free usage, full medical data access, unlimited scans and premium upgrades for the year. Everything in free registration stays exactly as it is.</div></div></div></div><div class="acc-item"><h3 class="acc-h"><button class="acc-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" id="acc-b-unlimited" aria-controls="acc-p-unlimited">What does “unlimited scans” mean?<span class="plus"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" ><path d="M12 5v14"/><path d="M5 12h14"/></svg></span></button></h3>
